9325,10801975,16905975,27256475,12219950,49718825,117679725,91275625,41647675,78694150,63220150,120417250,124343750,56494750,19900350,44648125,18361900,33402450,19961150,19524025,12436325,32748550,16472200,19520575,36817350,32611475,25511325,124126825,406192425,95050475,22940600,63525900,58330250,19953800,35139050,19032450,13576100,14565550,15587625,7407725,11533575,20483600,3132175,4779625,1330375,33173725,4766700,5587800,2680925,2164825,3518925,1290550,2393725,1754525,5790325,4087175,12763950,3215825,2671900,2996775,1461525,2432575,889525,3214675,3140525,2755600,37096700,15103650,7124250,10990325,1615725,7470575,3261425,2179050,1765500,17139250,2188325,3085975,1486950,2291150,1122650,512175,1748150,2109025,2333725,2761025,1243425,1415800,988425,2991850,4557275,3225600,3158050,18873600,2301000,3146900,1163400,480200,6581500,11913700,10474200,3014400,1516700,1593000]}},"profile":{"website":"https://aldrich.my","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","employees":86,"city":"Kuala Lumpur","summary":"Aldrich Resources Berhad offers computerized maintenance management systems in Malaysia. It provides asset and facility management system that manages the life cycle of an asset and facility; hospital information system to manage various aspects of a hospital's operation; and monitoring of application and performance system. The company also offers helpdesk system to automate the distribution process by sending the complaints to the intended receiver; customized solutions; integration services; and e-procurement system that allows a fluid exchange of information in the purchasing and selling market. In addition, it provides other information technology services, support services, and training; and asset auditing and tagging, digital transformation consulting, and IT operational intelligence assessment services. Further, the company offers consultancy and development services for mobile applications and interactions; software development and programming services; management, advisory, and consultancy services; and secretarial and management consultancy, mineral resources mining, processing, and trading and related services, as well as e-wallet and mobile banking applications for the financial and merchant industry. It serves customers in healthcare, oil and gas, property development and construction, hospitality, consultancy, and ICT markets, as well as government agencies and local authorities. The company was formerly known as Orion IXL Berhad and changed its name to Aldrich Resources Berhad in December 2021. The company was incorporated in 2001 and is based in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"Aldrich Resources Berhad 是一家总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡的信息技术服务公司，成立于2001年，前身为 Orion IXL Berhad，于2021年12月更名为现名。公司主要提供计算机化维护管理系统及相关IT解决方案，服务于医疗、石油天然气、房地产开发与建筑、酒店、咨询、ICT市场以及政府机构和地方当局。","lines":["计算机化维护管理系统：提供资产与设施管理系统，管理资产和设施的生命周期；医院信息系统，管理医院运营的各个方面；以及应用与性能监控系统。","帮助台系统：自动化投诉分发流程，将投诉发送给预定接收者。","定制解决方案与集成服务：提供定制化解决方案和系统集成服务。","电子采购系统：实现买卖市场中信息的流畅交换。","其他IT服务：提供IT支持服务、培训、资产审计与标签、数字化转型咨询、IT运营智能评估、移动应用咨询与开发、软件开发与编程、管理咨询、秘书与管理咨询、矿产资源开采加工贸易及相关服务，以及面向金融和商户行业的电子钱包和移动银行应用。"],"lines_en":["Computerized Maintenance Management Systems: Provides asset and facility management system managing life cycle of asset and facility; hospital information system managing various aspects of hospital operations; and application and performance monitoring system.","Helpdesk System: Automates distribution process by sending complaints to intended receiver.","Customized Solutions and Integration Services: Offers customized solutions and integration services.","E-Procurement System: Allows fluid exchange of information in purchasing and selling market.","Other IT Services: Provides IT support services, training, asset auditing and tagging, digital transformation consulting, IT operational intelligence assessment, mobile application consultancy and development, software development and programming, management advisory and consultancy, secretarial and management consultancy, mineral resources mining, processing and trading and related services, and e-wallet and mobile banking applications for financial and merchant industry."]}}